'''Attack, Step, Wait''' is an [[Combat Achievements/Elite|elite combat achievement]] which requires the player to survive [[Verzik Vitur]]'s second phase in the [[Theatre of Blood/Entry Mode|Theatre of Blood: Entry Mode]] without anyone getting bounced by Verzik.

==Strategy==
If you fail this achievement you can die and re-attempt Verzik within the same raid. You do not need to fully complete the raid to finish this task; you must simply defeat Verzik's 2nd phase without getting bounced.

